{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-probstat#feature-distributions","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-probstat","commit":"66bcd3cdc880fc62f75abeeeb025befa07fdc77","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-probstat 的分布计算功能：对正态、二项、泊松、指数、均匀和几何分布计算密度或质量、累积分布、生存概率、分位数及统计量。由 dist_calc 工具按分布和操作参数触发，返回数值结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:152-160","src/core.ts:73-98"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-probstat#feature-intervals","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-probstat","commit":"66bcd3cdc880fc62f75abeeeb025befa07fdc77","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-probstat 的置信区间功能：为已知方差均值、未知方差均值或比例构造区间，其中比例使用 Wilson 区间。调用 confidence_interval 并提供样本摘要、样本量及可选置信水平，得到上下界和误差范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:252-258"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-probstat#feature-tests","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-probstat","commit":"66bcd3cdc880fc62f75abeeeb025befa07fdc77","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-probstat 的检验功能：对单样本均值或比例，以及两组均值或比例执行统计检验，报告统计量、标准误、p 值和决定。调用 hypothesis_test 或 two_sample_test，并可指定尾部与显著性水平。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:357-367","src/tools.ts:476-489"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-probstat#feature-events","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-probstat","commit":"66bcd3cdc880fc62f75abeeeb025befa07fdc77","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-probstat 的事件概率功能：计算并集、交集、条件概率、贝叶斯后验、补事件及多次试验至少成功一次的概率。调用 event_probability 并选择操作，输入相应事件概率或先验与似然，获得结果及公式说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:301-309"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-probstat#feature-planning","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-probstat","commit":"66bcd3cdc880fc62f75abeeeb025befa07fdc77","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-probstat 的样本量规划功能：按已知标准差的均值估计或比例估计，计算满足目标误差范围所需样本数；比例支持 Wald 和 Wilson 方法。调用 sample_size 并提供误差范围、可选置信水平及参数，得到整数样本量。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:423-432"]}
